---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
---
<PageLayout
  title="Contact Us"
  heading="Contact Us"
  description="Contact the MarketTriggers.com editorial team with questions, corrections, topic suggestions, or partnership inquiries."
  canonicalPath="/contact/"
>
  <p>We read every message. Whether you spotted an error, have a question about one of our explainers, or want to suggest a topic, we'd like to hear from you.</p>

  <h2>Email</h2>
  <p><a href="mailto:info.christopherkunz@gmail.com" class="btn">info.christopherkunz@gmail.com</a></p>
  <p>We aim to respond within a few business days.</p>

  <h2>What to include</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Corrections:</strong> the page URL and the specific statement you believe is inaccurate, ideally with a source.</li>
    <li><strong>Topic suggestions:</strong> the market event or concept you'd like explained.</li>
    <li><strong>Business inquiries:</strong> a short description of your organization and request.</li>
  </ul>

  <div class="callout">
    <strong>Please note:</strong> We can't provide personalized investment advice or recommendations about specific securities. For advice about your own situation, please consult a licensed financial professional.
  </div>
</PageLayout>
